(2) The concept of impact breakage atomization It is a hard question to use superimposing atomizing mechanism on turning bias plate, requiring small weight possibly, without increasing its structure complexity. Such, it can avoid affecting the life of electric motor. Via repeating tests and amending ways, the final scheme is decided as follows. There are two plates on atomizing device. The upper is atomizing plate and the lower is a plate with fine threads installed at the edge of the plate vertically. The two plates turn reversely. The setting position of the atomizing plate is installed in the middle of the plate with fine threads without affecting turning of the two plates designated in Figure 1. The foggy metal drips thrown off from the atomizing plate are lashed and impacted by the fine threads to become pulverized before solidifying, achieving the further aim of atomizing foggy metal drips.
