Result analyzing, metal liquid flow speed affects the size of powder majorly. This is because the less metal liquid have been thrown off in unit time, the plate with fine threads can touch more foggy metal drips and the impacting and atomizing function of fine threads would be more efficiently and better effect. Visibly, the plate diameter, the turning speed of plate and metal liquid flow are the important factors of affecting the powder size and production efficiency. To enhancing the turning speed of the two plates and increasing the diameter of atomizing plate are helpful of decreasing powder size, increasing atomizing efficiency. IV IVIV IV Conclusion
The practice proves that the trinity of centrifugation, vibration and impact breakage atomization mechanism is scientific and advanced. This new atomization theory of the trinity breaks through the traditional theory of single atomization mechanism. It is a very good solution to low efficiency, or bad atomization effect, or higher energy costs in the single atomization mechanism, and it is also a beneficial attempt to make a breakthrough of the traditional atomization principle.
